  abilityId: 2850988
  abilityName: Voidlight Collapse
  abilityDesc: 23 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    12 combo Light attack on single foe (25% active Pierce on Light, Dark foes),
    boosts spark damage for 4 turns, spark damage restores HP for 4 turns, boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec for 4 turns & 1 extra action for 1 turn
